title V3 - Evidence-first answering
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Postgres pgvector [shape: cylinder, icon: database, color: blue]

Understand [color: purple] {
  User [icon: user]
  Chat history [icon: clock]
  Follow-up rewriter [icon: edit]
}

Retrieve [color: blue] {
  Top-6 cosine search [icon: search]
  Relevance gate [shape: diamond, icon: filter, color: orange]
}

Evidence [color: green] {
  Sentence numbering [icon: list]
  LLM selects sentence IDs [icon: message-circle]
  Code looks up exact sentences [icon: code]
}

Answer [color: purple] {
  LLM answers from quotes only [icon: message-circle]
}

Verify [color: orange] {
  Citation check [icon: check-square]
  Batch LLM fact check [icon: shield]
  Remove unsupported sentences [icon: scissors]
}

Refusal [icon: x-octagon, color: red]

User > Follow-up rewriter: question
Chat history > Follow-up rewriter
Follow-up rewriter > Top-6 cosine search: standalone question
Top-6 cosine search <> Postgres pgvector
Top-6 cosine search > Relevance gate
Relevance gate > Refusal: nothing relevant
Relevance gate > Sentence numbering
Sentence numbering > LLM selects sentence IDs
LLM selects sentence IDs > Code looks up exact sentences: IDs like 2.5
Code looks up exact sentences > Refusal: no valid evidence
Code looks up exact sentences > LLM answers from quotes only: verified quotes
LLM answers from quotes only > Citation check
Citation check > Batch LLM fact check
Batch LLM fact check > Remove unsupported sentences
Remove unsupported sentences > Refusal: nothing supported left
Remove unsupported sentences > User: answer + evidence + sources
